~ hello
Crow: ...
Crow: It's so good to finally meet you, Keeper.
- Who are you?
	Crow: I am your dead Father, child. Your long lost Brothers.
	Crow: I'm your buried little Sister, your Best Friend and your Lover. 
	Crow: I am the Pup you lost when you were four. The Deer Carcass you saw on the side of the road when you were ten. 
	Crow: Most of all, I am your rotting Mother. The moldering Mother of all things, and of all beings. => hello2 
- That's... not my name. 
	Crow: It is not. It's much more than that. 
	Crow: It's who you are now, or at least, who you soon will be. 
	Crow: Your name is of no importance anymore, my child. => hello2
	
